(Myungseon) Ah, I have been in the obstetrics ward for 7 years.

245
00:10:22.456 --> 00:10:25.280
So kind and sweet
This is my first time seeing a sweet man.

246
00:10:26.634 --> 00:10:28.933
Ha, where else can you find a man like that?

247
00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:30.130
Sometimes

248
00:10:30.868 --> 00:10:32.367
I don't know if it's good

249
00:10:32.434 --> 00:10:33.667
Where are you?

250
00:10:33.734 --> 00:10:34.934
Where are you?

251
00:10:36.267 --> 00:10:37.203
at my house

252
00:10:43.434 --> 00:10:45.812
(Seungwon) Dowon says he’s going into surgery, he’s sorry.

253
00:10:45.879 --> 00:10:47.700
(Jooyoung) Well, I’m sorry

254
00:10:47.767 --> 00:10:49.816
What's the big deal about egg retrieval?

255
00:10:49.883 --> 00:10:51.951
I'm not even nervous because it's my fifth time

256
00:10:52.018 --> 00:10:54.420
- (Seungwon) Should I call my sister-in-law?
- (Jooyoung) Don’t do it.

257
00:10:54.487 --> 00:10:56.789
For my peace of mind today
I'll only see the good

258
00:10:56.856 --> 00:10:58.091
So I didn't say anything on purpose.

259
00:11:04.097 --> 00:11:06.132
It must have been about 7 months, right?

260
00:11:07.501 --> 00:11:10.100
(Seungwon) 7 months later, it must be hard

261
00:11:10.167 --> 00:11:13.500
At that time, the waist, ribs, soles of the feet

262
00:11:13.567 --> 00:11:16.467
They say there's no pain, they say it's really hard

263
00:11:16.534 --> 00:11:17.700
How do you know so well?

264
00:11:17.767 --> 00:11:19.012
I searched everything too

265
00:11:19.079 --> 00:11:21.226
[laughter]

266
00:11:24.767 --> 00:11:26.966
(Jooyoung) I guess you came here to have a baby, right?

267
00:11:27.033 --> 00:11:29.055
(Seungwon) Childbirth? Oh my

268
00:11:29.667 --> 00:11:31.400
They say everything is like that after giving birth

269
00:11:31.467 --> 00:11:32.867
Pregnancy was gum

270
00:11:32.934 --> 00:11:34.828
True hell is parenting

271
00:11:35.459 --> 00:11:37.167
They say you age one year every day.

272
00:11:37.234 --> 00:11:39.199
[Surprise] I don’t want to get old

273
00:11:39.266 --> 00:11:41.133
(Seungwon) That’s right, I don’t like it.

274
00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:44.200
How can I cancel now and go home?

275
00:11:44.267 --> 00:11:45.171
no

276
00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:47.040
I'll do it though

277
00:11:47.634 --> 00:11:48.641
I'm going to do it, I

278
00:11:51.712 --> 00:11:53.591
Don't be sorry?

279
00:11:54.167 --> 00:11:56.267
I'm not doing it for you, am I?

280
00:11:56.334 --> 00:11:58.901
Because of my mother's nagging
I'm not even doing it.

281
00:11:58.968 --> 00:12:00.800
I'm doing it for me

282
00:12:00.867 --> 00:12:02.567
I'm doing it because I want to.

283
00:12:02.634 --> 00:12:04.257
I want to be a mother

284
00:12:05.292 --> 00:12:07.494
(Seungwon) I’m afraid it might be as hard as last time.

285
00:12:08.968 --> 00:12:10.300
(Jooyoung) Isn’t that right?

286
00:12:10.367 --> 00:12:11.531
Don’t you know the beauty of Yujong?

287
00:12:12.031 --> 00:12:13.667
The last one is all beautiful

288
00:12:13.734 --> 00:12:15.902
[Calm music]
[Jooyoung’s trembling sigh]

289
00:12:16.502 --> 00:12:18.004
This is really the last time

290
00:12:19.392 --> 00:12:20.740
3 or 4

291
00:12:21.675 --> 00:12:24.511
I'll do just that much as far as modifications go.

292
00:12:25.012 --> 00:12:27.480
After that, I won’t do it, I can’t do it.

293
00:12:32.100 --> 00:12:32.984
[Sound of patting back]

294
00:12:33.051 --> 00:12:34.387
My husband, please cheer up too.

295
00:12:34.454 --> 00:12:36.901
Oh, what am I doing, I'm fine

296
00:12:36.968 --> 00:12:38.792
I'm fine too

297
00:12:38.859 --> 00:12:41.661
I got an injection in my stomach today
It didn't hurt much

298
00:12:42.300 --> 00:12:45.565
Egg retrieval is under sedation.
It's over when you wake up, well

299
00:12:46.267 --> 00:12:47.400
[Jooyoung makes a noise]

300
00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:50.770
It's time, shall we go in?

301
00:12:51.338 --> 00:12:52.372
(Seungwon) Oh

302
00:12:57.398 --> 00:12:59.846
(Nurse) Jooyoung Oh, I’m coming in.

303
00:12:59.913 --> 00:13:02.307
[Mouse and keyboard operation sounds]
[humorous music]

304
00:13:07.854 --> 00:13:10.056
(Juyeon) It’s 3:40 now.
Only 20 minutes left

305
00:13:10.123 --> 00:13:11.790
[upbeat music]
I'm going down again

306
00:13:11.857 --> 00:13:13.293
Teacher, you're coming up, right?

307
00:13:13.360 --> 00:13:15.033
Yes, it's going up.

308
00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:17.063
Huh? I think I'm going to die soon, teacher.

309
00:13:17.130 --> 00:13:19.932
(Dahye) No, while I was prescribing for 9 people
Did you do it with 4 people?

310
00:13:19.999 --> 00:13:21.367
Oh, come up quickly.

311
00:13:21.434 --> 00:13:23.233
There are still 6 people left!

312
00:13:23.300 --> 00:13:26.100
This is the maximum speed I can achieve.
sorry

313
00:13:26.167 --> 00:13:28.308
If you don't get a prescription within 4 o'clock and are pushed back on chemotherapy,

314
00:13:28.375 --> 00:13:30.377
There will be a real war then, you know?

315
00:13:30.444 --> 00:13:31.333
[Mouse and keyboard operation sounds]
yes, i know

316
00:13:31.400 --> 00:13:33.867
(Dahye) When that war breaks out
we die first

317
00:13:33.934 --> 00:13:36.300
Professor Joonmo Jo
Because I'm going to shoot with my mouth.

318
00:13:36.367 --> 00:13:37.667
[Mouse operation sound]

319
00:13:37.734 --> 00:13:39.852
Wait a minute, BSA is 1.5

320
00:13:39.919 --> 00:13:42.066
- 1.5 times 135 is
- (Residing in Japan) 202.5

321
00:13:42.133 --> 00:13:43.634
(Dahye) What, were you a genius?

322
00:13:43.701 --> 00:13:46.760
When I was Eomjju, my personal skills were mental calculations.
I was just playing against a calculator.

323
00:13:46.827 --> 00:13:49.094
[Sound of bones crunching]
(Dahye) Oh, huh? Don't take your hands off the keyboard

324
00:13:49.161 --> 00:13:50.534
Are those hand hair important now?

325
00:13:50.601 --> 00:13:52.367
It really looks like the hairs are flying off?

326
00:13:52.434 --> 00:13:53.367
sorry

327
00:13:53.434 --> 00:13:55.135
(Jaehwi) Hello, how are you?

328
00:13:55.202 --> 00:13:56.667
(together) Hello, professor

329
00:13:56.734 --> 00:13:58.200
I had a meeting in the afternoon

330
00:13:58.267 --> 00:14:02.033
(Jaehwi) People who had surgery in the morning
I'm thinking of doing some rounds.

331
00:14:02.100 --> 00:14:03.043
(together) Ah!

332
00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:03.966
yes

333
00:14:04.033 --> 00:14:05.078
It won't work

334
00:14:05.601 --> 00:14:06.767
(Jaehwi) Who, who is it?

335
00:14:06.834 --> 00:14:09.482
At 3:40 in the gynecology department without anyone noticing

336
00:14:10.501 --> 00:14:12.084
I made rounds, I made rounds

337
00:14:12.151 --> 00:14:13.000
[Jaeil’s light smile]

338
00:14:13.067 --> 00:14:14.467
I turned
[Dahye’s laughter]

339
00:14:14.534 --> 00:14:15.634
I'm sorry

340
00:14:15.701 --> 00:14:17.425
Work hard and do it

341
00:14:17.492 --> 00:14:18.925
(Together) Thank you!

342
00:14:18.992 --> 00:14:20.400
(Dahye) Quickly, quickly!

343
00:14:20.467 --> 00:14:22.061
[Mouse and keyboard operation sounds]

344
00:14:22.863 --> 00:14:24.163
Okay, okay, still okay.

345
00:14:27.234 --> 00:14:30.036
[snoring sound]

346
00:14:33.659 --> 00:14:35.208
[Nanjing’s sigh]

347
00:14:35.275 --> 00:14:36.743
[Sound of door opening]
[Chant plays]

348
00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:38.010
(Nanjing) Hello

349
00:14:38.077 --> 00:14:39.479
(Smile) Oh, hello?

350
00:14:39.546 --> 00:14:40.847
[Nanjing’s laughter]
[Chant plays]

351
00:14:43.350 --> 00:14:45.300
Do you listen to this song every day?

352
00:14:45.367 --> 00:14:48.121
It's my favorite hymn

353
00:14:48.188 --> 00:14:50.423
(Nanjing) Oh, you go to church.

354
00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:52.600
(Smile) Teacher, don’t you have any religion?

355
00:14:52.667 --> 00:14:54.767
(Nanjing) Yes, I have shamanism.

356
00:14:54.834 --> 00:14:55.801
[Smile chuckles]

357
00:14:55.868 --> 00:14:58.133
Last month, she was the fairy Wang Bangul.

358
00:14:58.200 --> 00:15:00.534
This month, I switched to Gangnam Doryeongnim.

359
00:15:00.601 --> 00:15:01.801
You are very gifted

360
00:15:01.868 --> 00:15:03.203
[Light smile]

361
00:15:03.270 --> 00:15:05.107
How are you feeling?

362
00:15:05.174 --> 00:15:07.140
Uh, isn't it hard to breathe?

363
00:15:07.701 --> 00:15:09.033
It's okay

364
00:15:09.100 --> 00:15:11.464
You must be busy, so why do you always greet me?

365
00:15:11.531 --> 00:15:13.980
(Namkyung) Hey, if you still want to come to the hospital
The face needs to be seen.

366
00:15:14.047 --> 00:15:15.448
You're my first wife's patient.

367
00:15:16.601 --> 00:15:18.918
Well, thanks to that, I didn't run away.

368
00:15:19.467 --> 00:15:20.486
That's right

369
00:15:21.234 --> 00:15:24.033
He ran away and came back, thinking I was dead.

370
00:15:24.100 --> 00:15:25.224
I can't believe I'm dying

371
00:15:25.291 --> 00:15:26.834
Oh, that's not it

372
00:15:26.901 --> 00:15:30.529
(Namkyung) Because I didn’t know anything at that time
I came back because I was surprised.

373
00:15:30.596 --> 00:15:32.398
Because March is such a fool

374
00:15:33.434 --> 00:15:36.000
Still, better than then
Do you think things are starting to get a bit familiar?

375
00:15:36.067 --> 00:15:37.233
Your face is much better

376
00:15:37.300 --> 00:15:38.738
Not at all?

377
00:15:39.534 --> 00:15:42.141
Since I'm getting used to the work, there's a lot more work to do.

378
00:15:43.033 --> 00:15:43.943
[Nanjing’s sigh]

379
00:15:44.434 --> 00:15:45.645
(Nanjing) Work is work.

380
00:15:46.145 --> 00:15:48.233
People are dying from stress these days.

381
00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:49.816
Who are you, patient?

382
00:15:50.934 --> 00:15:51.884
professor?

383
00:15:52.601 --> 00:15:54.554
No, motivation.

384
00:15:56.190 --> 00:15:58.891
[humorous music]
(Nam-kyung) I’m not very lucky with my classmates, am I?

385
00:15:58.958 --> 00:16:00.933
[Sighing] One person is unlucky.

386
00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:02.661
One person is out of his mind

387
00:16:02.728 --> 00:16:06.666
One person has no humanity
There is no flexibility or understanding.

388
00:16:07.501 --> 00:16:10.103
not a person
It's like talking to AI.

389
00:16:10.734 --> 00:16:11.567
Besides
[Knocking sound]

390
00:16:11.634 --> 00:16:14.200
Even something like this is just
Stick to it until the end, huh?

391
00:16:14.267 --> 00:16:16.567
Is it always in the book?

392
00:16:16.634 --> 00:16:17.834
I know because I saw it?

393
00:16:17.901 --> 00:16:20.179
He says everything he said is correct.

394
00:16:20.714 --> 00:16:23.107
Haha, I'm just frustrated.

395
00:16:23.174 --> 00:16:24.484
I can't speak

396
00:16:24.551 --> 00:16:26.519
It's completely opposite to me.

397
00:16:27.601 --> 00:16:30.189
Huh? The professor went on rounds?

398
00:16:32.192 --> 00:16:33.734
(Sabi) Oh, it’s not rounds.

399
00:16:33.801 --> 00:16:37.066
The professor said the CT results came out.
He asked me to explain it again.

400
00:16:37.133 --> 00:16:40.500
There is nothing wrong with the video.
Tumor marker levels are also decreasing.

401
00:16:40.567 --> 00:16:42.769
If you receive this chemotherapy treatment well,
I think it will work

402
00:16:43.567 --> 00:16:44.504
(Smile) Yes

403
00:16:45.772 --> 00:16:46.744
Take a break

404
00:16:48.976 --> 00:16:52.512
[Sound of door opening and closing]

405
00:16:52.579 --> 00:16:54.247
[light music]
[Nanjing’s sigh]

406
00:16:57.067 --> 00:16:58.701
[Sighing] It's ruined.

407
00:17:01.121 --> 00:17:02.088
(Japan) Now

408
00:17:03.167 --> 00:17:04.123
um

409
00:17:05.025 --> 00:17:06.259
[Sound of door opening]

410
00:17:14.501 --> 00:17:15.966
I don't like pig's feet

411
00:17:16.033 --> 00:17:19.105
(Japan) Sabi wanted to eat it, so I ordered it.
just eat

412
00:17:20.274 --> 00:17:22.267
Hey, I heard you have plans for dinner tonight?

413
00:17:22.334 --> 00:17:24.743
I have some time left so I just want to taste it.

414
00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:25.966
(Residence in Japan) Yes

415
00:17:26.033 --> 00:17:28.700
(Namkyung) But did you wash your hands?

416
00:17:28.767 --> 00:17:32.333
Uh, I washed it as thoroughly as I scrubbed.

417
00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:33.667
I just didn't wash my hair

418
00:17:33.734 --> 00:17:34.767
(Namkyung) Yes

419
00:17:34.834 --> 00:17:36.033
(Sabi) Didn’t you go home again?

420
00:17:36.100 --> 00:17:37.167
You weren't on duty, right?

421
00:17:37.234 --> 00:17:38.567
(Japan) Write...

422
00:17:38.634 --> 00:17:40.293
I don't think you guys will believe it

423
00:17:40.961 --> 00:17:42.467
Every night these days

424
00:17:42.534 --> 00:17:43.933
Like voluntary duty...

425
00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:45.367
(Nanjing) [Clapping hands] Oh, that’s right.

426
00:17:45.434 --> 00:17:46.632
Who will be on duty in August?

427
00:17:47.434 --> 00:17:48.434
(Lee Young) Yes

428
00:17:48.501 --> 00:17:51.300
Hey, just give me the third weekend in August.

429
00:17:51.367 --> 00:17:52.867
I told you in advance, huh?

430
00:17:52.934 --> 00:17:56.008
uh? It's my dad's birthday in the third week too.
I was going to ask you a favor?

431
00:17:57.534 --> 00:17:58.367
think about it

432
00:17:58.434 --> 00:17:59.980
You don’t really think much.
[light music]

433
00:18:00.047 --> 00:18:02.415
(Nankyung) Why do you only think about things like this?
Don't do it, don't do it

434
00:18:03.317 --> 00:18:05.551
Sabi, is it your dad’s birthday?

435
00:18:06.601 --> 00:18:08.267
Hey, I said it first.

436
00:18:08.334 --> 00:18:10.700
What does it matter, it's the knitter's heart
[Namkyung’s absurd moans]

437
00:18:10.767 --> 00:18:13.693
(Jaeil) Hey, you guys
Why do you fight every time you are put on duty?

438
00:18:14.634 --> 00:18:15.796
Youngah Lee

439
00:18:15.863 --> 00:18:19.131
just be fair
Isn’t there a senior who is on duty on the third weekend?

440
00:18:19.198 --> 00:18:21.167
With that person
Make it with someone you are compatible with.

441
00:18:21.701 --> 00:18:22.869
(Nanjing) Compatibility?

442
00:18:22.936 --> 00:18:24.801
(Japan) Isn’t there Professor Woo Sang-ho of the orthopedic department?

443
00:18:24.868 --> 00:18:27.901
The professor said he chose the position based on compatibility.

444
00:18:27.968 --> 00:18:30.534
But strangely enough, in the month that the professor made,

445
00:18:30.601 --> 00:18:33.167
They say emergency services are guaranteed.
[Nankyung’s surprised gasp]

446
00:18:33.234 --> 00:18:34.200
- (Nanjing) Good
- (Sabi) I hate it.

447
00:18:34.267 --> 00:18:35.400
I'm a Christian

448
00:18:35.467 --> 00:18:36.600
[snort]

449
00:18:36.667 --> 00:18:38.251
What does that have to do with religion?

450
00:18:38.318 --> 00:18:40.033
So what does duty have to do with compatibility?

451
00:18:40.100 --> 00:18:41.642
Oh, I'm just doing it for fun.

452
00:18:41.709 --> 00:18:43.869
That's because being on duty isn't something you do for fun.

453
00:18:44.901 --> 00:18:46.525
(Namkyung) So it’s not fun.

454
00:18:46.592 --> 00:18:48.634
Even something like this
I'm just saying let's have fun.

455
00:18:48.701 --> 00:18:50.233
(Sabi) That’s right
Being on duty isn't fun.

456
00:18:50.300 --> 00:18:52.232
Why do you do it that way?

457
00:18:52.299 --> 00:18:53.399
Wow...

458
00:18:53.967 --> 00:18:55.001
you are really frustrating

459
00:18:55.068 --> 00:18:57.104
I am an alumnus, I am frustrated too.

460
00:18:57.171 --> 00:18:58.274
[snort]

461
00:18:59.434 --> 00:19:01.374
[cell phone ringing sound]
[Jaeil clears his throat]

462
00:19:04.167 --> 00:19:05.278
yes, teacher

463
00:19:06.480 --> 00:19:08.915
Sorry, I appreciate it.

464
00:19:10.082 --> 00:19:11.333
(Japan) I'm going

465
00:19:11.400 --> 00:19:13.634
Not yet
I thought it was okay if it wasn't here.

466
00:19:13.701 --> 00:19:14.787
yes
[Sound of door opening]

467
00:19:14.854 --> 00:19:15.689
(Together) Where are we going?

468
00:19:15.756 --> 00:19:17.223
[Sound of door closing]
[cell phone ringing sound]

469
00:19:19.725 --> 00:19:21.895
(Lee Young) You two agree, I’ll go first.

470
00:19:21.962 --> 00:19:23.596
(Together) Hey, where are you going!

471
00:19:31.701 --> 00:19:33.701
[eerie music]

472
00:19:40.314 --> 00:19:41.534
(Jae-il) Hello?

473
00:19:41.601 --> 00:19:42.815
(Taerim) Oh, are you here?

474
00:19:44.251 --> 00:19:46.185
Thank you for not forgetting to call

475
00:19:47.033 --> 00:19:49.200
(Jaeil) But because of me
You couldn’t go home?

476
00:19:49.267 --> 00:19:50.456
(Taerim) No way

477
00:19:51.057 --> 00:19:52.901
Because ultrasound image data is organized

478
00:19:52.968 --> 00:19:54.500
I can't go home this week

479
00:19:54.567 --> 00:19:56.997
[Surprisingly] It must be very difficult.

480
00:19:57.064 --> 00:19:59.295
I don’t think it’s time to worry about others, right?

481
00:20:00.367 --> 00:20:01.700
(Taerim) Are you okay?

482
00:20:01.767 --> 00:20:03.503
You look very tired

483
00:20:03.570 --> 00:20:05.838
It's okay, you can go to sleep after seeing the ultrasound.

484
00:20:06.367 --> 00:20:09.167
But if an emergency maternal ultrasound occurs at night,

485
00:20:09.234 --> 00:20:10.534
Do you keep calling me?

486
00:20:10.601 --> 00:20:12.000
Are you going to continue to observe?

487
00:20:12.067 --> 00:20:14.113
Yeah, I'd like to do it for a few more weeks.

488
00:20:15.000 --> 00:20:17.133
Can I ask you a favor?
[light laughter]

489
00:20:17.200 --> 00:20:19.519
Yeah, it's not that difficult.

490
00:20:19.586 --> 00:20:21.000
thank you

491
00:20:21.067 --> 00:20:22.333
(Taerim) Always around this time

492
00:20:22.400 --> 00:20:25.233
The first-year teachers were very impatient.

493
00:20:25.300 --> 00:20:26.392
Because I want to do well

494
00:20:27.667 --> 00:20:28.728
I'm not

495
00:20:29.767 --> 00:20:31.297
