He tells me to do everything that’s left.

999
00:43:49.901 --> 00:43:50.828
[sigh]

1000
00:43:52.466 --> 00:43:53.667
Hey XXXX
[Beeping sound effect]

1001
00:43:53.734 --> 00:43:55.857
[lively music]

1002
00:44:39.000 --> 00:44:40.545
(Sabi) The professor saw it and commented.

1003
00:44:42.100 --> 00:44:43.181
But aren’t you hungry?

1004
00:44:46.334 --> 00:44:47.854
Still, it ended sooner than expected

1005
00:44:47.921 --> 00:44:49.520
It's only half past ten

1006
00:44:50.167 --> 00:44:51.389
(Nanjing) 10:30

1007
00:44:52.767 --> 00:44:53.891
Is it 10:30 now?

1008
00:44:57.701 --> 00:44:58.596
what?

1009
00:44:59.734 --> 00:45:01.066
I read it

1010
00:45:01.133 --> 00:45:02.900
Ki-dong, did you read this?

1011
00:45:03.968 --> 00:45:05.100
No, when did you see it?

1012
00:45:05.167 --> 00:45:06.771
Oh, I'm sure you didn't see it earlier?

1013
00:45:07.901 --> 00:45:09.307
Hey, it's past 9:30 now, right?

1014
00:45:09.834 --> 00:45:10.933
Yes, it's 10:32 now.

1015
00:45:11.000 --> 00:45:12.600
(Namkyung) Oh, what should I do?

1016
00:45:12.667 --> 00:45:14.281
What if I waited for him?

1017
00:45:14.348 --> 00:45:15.266
(Xavi) Who? what?

1018
00:45:15.333 --> 00:45:16.714
Oh, I don't know, I don't know.

1019
00:45:17.518 --> 00:45:18.850
Really, this is all because of you!

1020
00:45:22.689 --> 00:45:24.110
What are you saying?

1021
00:45:31.298 --> 00:45:32.697
[Door bell sounds]

1022
00:45:34.868 --> 00:45:36.023
[Door bell sounds]

1023
00:45:39.706 --> 00:45:40.972
[Door bell sounds]
[Call connection tone]

1024
00:45:41.508 --> 00:45:42.640
[Nanjing’s sigh]

1025
00:45:44.444 --> 00:45:46.711
Did you not come, or did you come and go?
[Call end sound]

1026
00:45:48.067 --> 00:45:50.381
[Sighing] Is he really mad at me?

1027
00:45:51.084 --> 00:45:54.585
[Call connection tone]

1028
00:46:01.061 --> 00:46:02.894
[Sound of door opening]

1029
00:46:03.510 --> 00:46:06.363
(Kiseon) Oh, I’m going to Myeong-won’s conference.
You're presenting your thesis tomorrow, right?

1030
00:46:06.430 --> 00:46:07.164
(Dowon) Yes

1031
00:46:07.231 --> 00:46:08.266
(Kiseon) Who goes to the first year?

1032
00:46:10.037 --> 00:46:11.002
Oh I-young

1033
00:46:11.905 --> 00:46:14.033
I have a promise this time too

1034
00:46:14.100 --> 00:46:17.041
I have work at home and I'm going to be sick, right?

1035
00:46:18.512 --> 00:46:19.867
You never went to a conference.

1036
00:46:19.934 --> 00:46:21.901
You know that’s a requirement for completing a major, right?

1037
00:46:21.968 --> 00:46:22.880
When are you going?

1038
00:46:23.483 --> 00:46:24.700
I'll go next time

1039
00:46:24.767 --> 00:46:26.217
Go this time, that's an order.

1040
00:46:27.100 --> 00:46:28.901
- (Kiseon) Dowon is going, right?
- yes?

1041
00:46:28.968 --> 00:46:31.689
(Kiseon) Our second author should go too.
It's a good day, right?

1042
00:46:32.826 --> 00:46:35.434
Okay
I will go with teacher Oh I-young.

1043
00:46:35.501 --> 00:46:38.228
(Kiseon) Yes, we had a hard time together.
Eat something delicious

1044
00:46:38.295 --> 00:46:39.966
Come and have a drink
[Sound of snapping fingers]

1045
00:46:40.033 --> 00:46:41.032
(Dowon) Yes

1046
00:46:46.573 --> 00:46:47.641
[Lee Young’s exasperated groan]

1047
00:46:47.708 --> 00:46:48.734
[Sound of door opening]

1048
00:46:48.801 --> 00:46:50.534
(Kiseon) I removed the balloon and watched it.

1049
00:46:50.601 --> 00:46:52.067
No bleeding at all

1050
00:46:52.134 --> 00:46:53.200
very good

1051
00:46:53.267 --> 00:46:55.300
(Bomi) Yes, thank you

1052
00:46:55.367 --> 00:46:57.915
(Kiseon) But today
Can't you see your husband?

1053
00:46:58.694 --> 00:46:59.795
(Bomi) Ah...

1054
00:46:59.862 --> 00:47:02.333
(Kiseon) My husband
You are very popular in the ward.

1055
00:47:02.400 --> 00:47:04.600
I'm so jealous of everyone that my stomach hurts

1056
00:47:04.667 --> 00:47:06.156
Shouldn’t I have an abdominal ultrasound?

1057
00:47:06.223 --> 00:47:07.734
[Kiseon’s laughter]
[humorous music]

1058
00:47:07.801 --> 00:47:10.933
Everyone says so sweet, so sweet

1059
00:47:11.000 --> 00:47:13.497
I thought your last name was So, right?

1060
00:47:13.564 --> 00:47:16.233
[Kiseon’s laughter]
[Awkward laughter from medical staff]

1061
00:47:16.300 --> 00:47:19.600
I don’t want to see my husband like that either.
I told him to go home.

1062
00:47:19.667 --> 00:47:21.272
I won't come for a while

1063
00:47:21.742 --> 00:47:22.700
Yes, yes?

1064
00:47:22.767 --> 00:47:23.841
No, why?

1065
00:47:24.545 --> 00:47:26.313
Where else can you find such a caring husband?

1066
00:47:26.380 --> 00:47:27.481
(Kisun) Ah...

1067
00:47:27.548 --> 00:47:29.834
Because they're so attached and showing off

1068
00:47:29.901 --> 00:47:31.167
You don’t like that again?

1069
00:47:31.234 --> 00:47:32.200
A

1070
00:47:32.267 --> 00:47:33.517
- Still...
- Professor (Dowon)

1071
00:47:34.054 --> 00:47:36.754
I think mother No. 6107, Hannah Na-kyung, is waiting.

1072
00:47:36.821 --> 00:47:39.634
According to the professor, you are someone who believes like the Bible.

1073
00:47:39.701 --> 00:47:42.200
I think you've been waiting since dawn
Let's go quickly

1074
00:47:42.267 --> 00:47:44.397
(Kisun) That’s right, I’m going to have to wait a long time.

1075
00:47:44.464 --> 00:47:46.030
Let's go quickly then

1076
00:47:50.667 --> 00:47:52.870
[cell phone ringing sound]

1077
00:48:01.048 --> 00:48:02.480
This is Jaeil Eom, an obstetrician and gynecologist.

1078
00:48:04.400 --> 00:48:06.384
There today...

1079
00:48:07.267 --> 00:48:09.887
Today is Saturday so I am off.

1080
00:48:10.757 --> 00:48:13.933
The mother was looking for a teacher.
I tried calling just in case.

1081
00:48:14.000 --> 00:48:15.434
(Jay) Ah...

1082
00:48:15.501 --> 00:48:16.527
teacher

1083
00:48:17.701 --> 00:48:19.730
I'll just pass it once today

1084
00:48:20.467 --> 00:48:21.966
Just once

1085
00:48:22.033 --> 00:48:24.567
(Taerim) Yes, to teacher Oh I-young.
I'll call you

1086
00:48:24.634 --> 00:48:25.670
Take a break

1087
00:48:27.167 --> 00:48:28.066
(Japan) No

1088
00:48:28.133 --> 00:48:30.474
But are you looking for me?

1089
00:48:31.601 --> 00:48:33.177
Is there someone looking for me?

1090
00:48:35.300 --> 00:48:37.300
[Calm music]

1091
00:48:39.350 --> 00:48:41.686
(Japan) Yesterday and today
Did you have any symptoms?

1092
00:48:42.656 --> 00:48:43.542
yes

1093
00:48:44.424 --> 00:48:45.789
(Youngshin) Ah

1094
00:48:45.856 --> 00:48:49.060
Today is a scheduled outpatient day.

1095
00:48:49.596 --> 00:48:51.061
I didn't just come

1096
00:48:51.128 --> 00:48:51.994
[light laughter]

1097
00:48:52.061 --> 00:48:53.400
I know

1098
00:48:53.467 --> 00:48:54.868
(Youngshin) Just like last time

1099
00:48:54.935 --> 00:48:57.434
Please look carefully, teacher.

1100
00:48:57.501 --> 00:48:59.603
Yes, I will try my best

1101
00:49:01.909 --> 00:49:04.909
(Jaeil) Oh, the baby’s heart is beating well.

1102
00:49:05.445 --> 00:49:06.811
I like the movement too

1103
00:49:07.467 --> 00:49:09.780
Is the amount of amniotic fluid appropriate?

1104
00:49:11.051 --> 00:49:12.966
And...

1105
00:49:13.033 --> 00:49:14.151
um

1106
00:49:16.734 --> 00:49:17.655
Huh?

1107
00:49:18.267 --> 00:49:19.256
[Button operation sound]

1108
00:49:21.228 --> 00:49:22.220
(Youngshin) Why?

1109
00:49:23.400 --> 00:49:24.895
What's strange?

1110
00:49:26.234 --> 00:49:27.901
- teacher?
- Yes

1111
00:49:27.968 --> 00:49:29.200
Professor, please notify me.

1112
00:49:29.736 --> 00:49:30.648
yes?

1113
00:49:31.601 --> 00:49:32.801
(Japan) It’s ambiguous, but

1114
00:49:32.868 --> 00:49:34.372
I can see something like blood vessels.

1115
00:49:35.542 --> 00:49:37.074
Please tell me I think you should take a look.

1116
00:49:37.778 --> 00:49:38.986
Ah, yes

1117
00:49:40.614 --> 00:49:41.634
[Call connection tone]

1118
00:49:41.701 --> 00:49:43.581
[Sound of opening and closing curtains]

1119
00:49:49.200 --> 00:49:51.222
It's not easy to find this

1120
00:49:54.176 --> 00:49:57.197
(Jeongmin) Jaeil, this is a Uterra line rupture.

1121
00:49:57.264 --> 00:49:58.759
(Residence in Japan) Huh? that?

1122
00:50:00.728 --> 00:50:01.834
maternal body

1123
00:50:01.901 --> 00:50:04.701
What you see now is the umbilical cord.

1124
00:50:04.768 --> 00:50:05.534
(Youngshin) Yes

1125
00:50:05.601 --> 00:50:07.567
(Jeongmin) The umbilical cord is like the amniotic sac.

1126
00:50:07.634 --> 00:50:10.007
slightly outside the uterine wall.

1127
00:50:10.074 --> 00:50:11.642
I see it's gone

1128
00:50:12.434 --> 00:50:14.700
Fortunately, the amniotic sac did not rupture.

1129
00:50:14.767 --> 00:50:16.650
What do you mean by that?

1130
00:50:16.717 --> 00:50:20.017
I think it would be better to have surgery and have a baby.

1131
00:50:20.084 --> 00:50:20.901
Yes?

1132
00:50:20.968 --> 00:50:21.955
(Jae-il) Shall we arrange the operating room?

1133
00:50:22.022 --> 00:50:24.221
(Jeongmin) Yes, now
There will be a room where the surgery is being completed.

1134
00:50:24.992 --> 00:50:25.923
yes

1135
00:50:26.533 --> 00:50:27.594
[Sound of curtain opening]

1136
00:50:27.661 --> 00:50:29.229
[Sound of curtain hitting]
(Jeongmin) While preparing for surgery

1137
00:50:29.296 --> 00:50:32.675
I need you to stay in the farrowing shed, so I'll be moving soon.

1138
00:50:32.742 --> 00:50:33.834
Don't be surprised

1139
00:50:33.901 --> 00:50:34.899
[Nervous breathing]

1140
00:50:36.184 --> 00:50:38.636
Isn’t there something wrong with the baby or something?

1141
00:50:39.601 --> 00:50:41.108
Are you okay, Professor?

1142
00:50:41.175 --> 00:50:43.808
To make sure there are no problems for the baby
I'm having surgery.

1143
00:50:45.033 --> 00:50:46.911
Don't worry too much

1144
00:50:47.834 --> 00:50:49.280
Trust me

1145
00:50:51.618 --> 00:50:52.750
[sigh]

1146
00:50:54.421 --> 00:50:56.987
[cell phone ringing sound]

1147
00:51:00.868 --> 00:51:01.959
Yes, professor

1148
00:51:03.200 --> 00:51:04.500
(Sabi) Yes?

1149
00:51:04.567 --> 00:51:06.130
There's no way I'm missing data.

1150
00:51:07.100 --> 00:51:09.065
Ah, that part was done by Namgyeong.

1151
00:51:10.834 --> 00:51:12.100
[humorous music]

1152
00:51:12.167 --> 00:51:14.710
You should have checked it last
sorry

1153
00:51:15.367 --> 00:51:17.208
I'll edit it and send it back...
[Call end sound]

1154
00:51:23.483 --> 00:51:24.981
Namkyung Pyo is real

1155
00:51:27.918 --> 00:51:28.789
(Dowon) Eat a lot

1156
00:51:28.856 --> 00:51:30.020
(Sabi) Hello

1157
00:51:33.557 --> 00:51:34.538
[sigh]

1158
00:51:38.234 --> 00:51:39.263
Why again, what is it?

1159
00:51:40.120 --> 00:51:41.367
teacher

1160
00:51:41.434 --> 00:51:43.667
As I live
Have you never fought with anyone?

1161
00:51:44.200 --> 00:51:46.937
But these days, every day passes by fighting.

1162
00:51:47.601 --> 00:51:48.639
(Dowon) Who are you fighting with?

1163
00:51:49.309 --> 00:51:50.307
(Sabi) Ah...

1164
00:51:51.044 --> 00:51:52.943
It's a bit weird to mention real names

1165
00:51:54.267 --> 00:51:56.547
My social rule is not to talk behind people’s backs.

1166
00:51:58.767 --> 00:51:59.717
(Dowon) Yes

1167
00:52:00.367 --> 00:52:01.167
Why are you fighting?

1168
00:52:01.234 --> 00:52:02.634
I don't understand

1169
00:52:02.701 --> 00:52:04.867
What you say, what you do
Everything you think about

1170
00:52:04.934 --> 00:52:07.258
(Sabi) When we talk to try to understand
I don't understand anymore

1171
00:52:08.100 --> 00:52:09.693
I really don't know what to do

1172
00:52:10.801 --> 00:52:11.762
(Dowon) Can you tell me?

1173
00:52:15.100 --> 00:52:16.333
don't try to understand

1174
00:52:17.400 --> 00:52:19.476
I guess it's just like that, huh?

1175
00:52:20.574 --> 00:52:23.541
I tried to understand it one by one
Nothing changes

1176
00:52:24.534 --> 00:52:26.744
You can abandon people, but you can't fix them.

1177
00:52:27.422 --> 00:52:31.487
In things where there is no room for improvement
In the end, you end up wasting your emotions and wasting your time.

1178
00:52:31.554 --> 00:52:32.950
I'm the only one losing money, so what are you doing?

1179
00:52:37.601 --> 00:52:38.901
Still

1180
00:52:38.968 --> 00:52:40.591
I guess I'll have to look into it, right?

1181
00:52:41.801 --> 00:52:44.395
(Sabi) Whether you can fix it or not
Because that's none of my business.

1182
00:52:45.262 --> 00:52:46.933
I say whatever I have to say

1183
00:52:47.000 --> 00:52:48.267
I'm the one who suffered

1184
00:52:48.334 --> 00:52:49.967
Why do I have to endure everything?

1185
00:52:50.834 --> 00:52:51.902
I can't do that.

1186
00:52:59.580 --> 00:53:01.815
(Jeongmin) The baby is okay

1187
00:53:01.882 --> 00:53:03.647
to 2.3kg

1188
00:53:03.714 --> 00:53:05.552
It's a bit small compared to the main body.

1189
00:53:05.619 --> 00:53:09.801
Heart rate, breathing, movement are all good.

1190
00:53:09.868 --> 00:53:11.091
[light sigh]

1191
00:53:11.158 --> 00:53:15.025
I saw that ultrasound a lot.

1192
00:53:16.029 --> 00:53:17.367
(Eunmi) Ah, that...

1193
00:53:17.434 --> 00:53:20.901
(Jeongmin) I looked at the previous ultrasound.

1194
00:53:20.968 --> 00:53:22.767
there was no problem

1195
00:53:22.834 --> 00:53:25.667
This is even if you see an ultrasound every day.

1196
00:53:25.734 --> 00:53:28.167
Either that night or the next morning

1197
00:53:28.234 --> 00:53:30.808
It can happen anytime.

1198
00:53:32.033 --> 00:53:33.177
That's not it

1199
00:53:34.334 --> 00:53:38.182
(Youngshin) I did an ultrasound
You've seen it a lot.

1200
00:53:38.986 --> 00:53:40.484
It hurts every time

1201
00:53:41.388 --> 00:53:42.886
While lying

1202
00:53:45.000 --> 00:53:49.126
on the internet
If you see posts like this saying the baby is wrong

1203
00:53:49.634 --> 00:53:53.167
I seem to have similar symptoms too.

1204
00:53:53.234 --> 00:53:56.934
Suddenly, my stomach, which didn't hurt before, suddenly feels like it hurts.

1205
00:53:57.601 --> 00:54:00.738
I know it's not true, but if I don't check,

1206
00:54:02.543 --> 00:54:04.208
I keep thinking bad thoughts

1207
00:54:05.045 --> 00:54:06.076
sorry

1208
00:54:06.667 --> 00:54:08.400
Teachers, because of me

1209
00:54:08.467 --> 00:54:10.899
It must have been really hard.

1210
00:54:10.966 --> 00:54:12.267
sorry

1211
00:54:12.334 --> 00:54:13.487
(together) Ah...

1212
00:54:13.554 --> 00:54:14.901
(Jeongmin) You can do that.

1213
00:54:14.968 --> 00:54:18.425
It must have been worse because it was her first pregnancy.

1214
00:54:18.492 --> 00:54:19.923
This is what happened

1215
00:54:20.467 --> 00:54:22.359
It's all because of me, teacher.

1216
00:54:22.901 --> 00:54:24.867
I even made the baby anxious

1217
00:54:24.934 --> 00:54:27.333
Something bad happened in your stomach.

1218
00:54:27.400 --> 00:54:30.570
Like I said, it's not like that.

1219
00:54:30.637 --> 00:54:33.073
The baby is healthy now, don’t worry.

1220
00:54:35.601 --> 00:54:38.342
My baby was born a week early

1221
00:54:39.634 --> 00:54:40.901
Are you really okay?

1222
00:54:40.968 --> 00:54:42.249
yes

1223
00:54:42.316 --> 00:54:45.218
I don't even go to the neonatal intensive care unit.

1224
00:54:45.285 --> 00:54:46.700
You're in the neonatal room.

1225
00:54:46.767 --> 00:54:48.700
If you are born early

1226
00:54:48.767 --> 00:54:51.321
They say there are a lot of problems with the lungs.

1227
00:54:52.000 --> 00:54:54.100
(Youngshin) There is no chance of that?

1228
00:54:54.167 --> 00:54:56.167
(Jeongmin) The baby’s lungs have reached maturity.

1229
00:54:56.234 --> 00:54:59.000
We did all the testing.

1230
00:54:59.067 --> 00:55:00.767
There's nothing to worry about now

1231
00:55:00.834 --> 00:55:03.170
You said it was a bit small

1232
00:55:03.237 --> 00:55:05.667
Not enough to worry about

1233
00:55:05.734 --> 00:55:06.904
It's okay

1234
00:55:07.374 --> 00:55:08.639
Well then

1235
00:55:11.334 --> 00:55:13.867
Can I live with peace of mind now?

1236
00:55:13.934 --> 00:55:14.945
[sigh]

1237
00:55:15.968 --> 00:55:19.416
(Youngshin) My baby
Because I was born healthy

1238
00:55:21.100 --> 00:55:23.187
Can I live without any worries now?

1239
00:55:24.658 --> 00:55:26.724
No, you can't.

1240
00:55:31.300 --> 00:55:33.133
Did you know that once you give birth, it’s over?

1241
00:55:33.200 --> 00:55:34.398
Is this just the beginning?

1242
00:55:37.868 --> 00:55:41.839
My mom turned 70 this year.

1243
00:55:42.734 --> 00:55:45.634
I'm worried
Still call me every morning

1244
00:55:45.701 --> 00:55:46.966
[Eunmi and Dahye laugh]

1245
00:55:47.033 --> 00:55:49.234
(Jeongmin) I get an upset stomach when I drink cold water in the morning.

1246
00:55:49.301 --> 00:55:51.583
Driving at night can cause accidents.

1247
00:55:52.451 --> 00:55:54.769
Don't go out on a rainy day

1248
00:55:55.856 --> 00:55:58.622
Ugh, my mom said it was really unusual.

1249
00:55:59.458 --> 00:56:02.233
I am doing the same with my daughter.

1250
00:56:02.300 --> 00:56:03.667
[Eunmi and Dahye laugh]

1251
00:56:03.734 --> 00:56:05.198
[Music: 'Someday I'll Be Wise'
‘Life as a Major’ OST]

1252
00:56:05.265 --> 00:56:07.567
My daughter is in the second year of middle school.

1253
00:56:07.634 --> 00:56:10.103
My ankles have been sore since yesterday.

1254
00:56:10.170 --> 00:56:12.333
Haha, I heard that sound

1255
00:56:12.400 --> 00:56:15.539
Is it a muscle tissue problem or a bone abnormality?

1256
00:56:16.143 --> 00:56:19.333
I had trouble sleeping because I was worried.

1257
00:56:19.400 --> 00:56:22.516
riding a bike this morning
School went well

1258
00:56:22.583 --> 00:56:23.914
[Medical staff laugh]

1259
00:56:24.918 --> 00:56:27.885
There are more things to worry about after giving birth.

1260
00:56:28.418 --> 00:56:31.658
So I hope there will be no worries
Throw it away

1261
00:56:33.937 --> 00:56:36.741
It's much better for moms' mental health.

1262
00:56:37.367 --> 00:56:38.796
kids give

1263
00:56:39.567 --> 00:56:42.478
You should think of it as the price of happiness.

1264
00:56:43.303 --> 00:56:44.401
What should I do?

1265
00:56:45.405 --> 00:56:47.267
But the good thing is

1266
00:56:47.334 --> 00:56:51.074
Most of the things I worry about
He didn't wake up

1267
00:56:54.367 --> 00:56:55.512
believe it

1268
00:56:56.334 --> 00:56:58.713
yes, thank you

1269
00:57:03.059 --> 00:57:04.421
(Youngshin’s husband) Honey, I prepared something for you.

1270
00:57:06.727 --> 00:57:09.693
Um, where did the teacher go?

1271
00:57:10.200 --> 00:57:12.634
(Youngshin) This is the person who looked at the ultrasound.

1272
00:57:12.701 --> 00:57:14.464
Ultrasound at this hospital

1273
00:57:14.934 --> 00:57:17.200
You are the teacher who sees me the best.

1274
00:57:17.267 --> 00:57:18.929
- (Dahye) Ah, uh...
- (Eunmi) Oh, that’s...

1275
00:57:19.940 --> 00:57:21.033
- (Dahye) Huh?
- (Eunmi) Where...

1276
00:57:21.100 --> 00:57:22.309
(Jeongmin) Where has he been all this time?

1277
00:57:22.376 --> 00:57:24.975
[Sound of newborn babies crying]

1278
00:57:27.347 --> 00:57:28.545
(Hongdo) Teacher Eom Jae-il?

1279
00:57:29.216 --> 00:57:30.183
(Residence in Japan) Huh?

1280
00:57:30.250 --> 00:57:31.167
hello?

1281
00:57:31.234 --> 00:57:32.686
(Hongdo) Oh, I can see it from here.

1282
00:57:32.753 --> 00:57:34.379
Oh, are you playing good tennis?

1283
00:57:34.446 --> 00:57:36.066
I haven't been to the club for 3 weeks.

1284
00:57:36.133 --> 00:57:38.734
Me too, I'm so busy these days

1285
00:57:38.801 --> 00:57:40.000
That's right

1286
00:57:40.067 --> 00:57:42.333
Where is the spirit to join a club after a year?

1287
00:57:42.400 --> 00:57:43.933
(Hongdo) I’m busy eating and sleeping.

1288
00:57:44.000 --> 00:57:45.195
I know because I tried it.

1289
00:57:45.801 --> 00:57:46.864
It's a lot of trouble

1290
00:57:48.567 --> 00:57:50.066
But what are you doing here?

1291
00:57:50.133 --> 00:57:52.233
Oh, I have a baby who was diagnosed with CS.

1292
00:57:52.300 --> 00:57:53.167
Who is Jaeil Eom?

1293
00:57:53.234 --> 00:57:54.938
The mother is worried about the baby.

1294
00:57:55.634 --> 00:57:57.875
(Japan) I took some pictures
I came here to show you.

1295
00:57:58.467 --> 00:58:00.313
It's so cute I can't go

1296
00:58:00.380 --> 00:58:01.478
[light laughter]

1297
00:58:02.182 --> 00:58:03.200
Is this him?

1298
00:58:03.267 --> 00:58:05.867
You have had a relationship with me since the ultrasound.

1299
00:58:05.934 --> 00:58:08.418
Also, this is the first baby whose umbilical cord I cut.

1300
00:58:09.056 --> 00:58:10.009
(Hongdo) Yes...

1301
00:58:11.091 --> 00:58:12.340
Ah, teacher

1302
00:58:12.407 --> 00:58:14.200
About 10 minutes after the baby comes out

1303
00:58:14.267 --> 00:58:16.467
I heard that the saturation is only 90%.

1304
00:58:16.534 --> 00:58:17.667
Is this okay?

1305
00:58:17.734 --> 00:58:18.966
That's normal

1306
00:58:19.033 --> 00:58:20.430
(Jaeil) Oh, I’m glad.

1307
00:58:21.435 --> 00:58:24.268
(Hongdo) After birth, minute by minute
Don't you know that oxygen saturation changes?

1308
00:58:25.172 --> 00:58:27.571
Even if it gets to 85% in 10 minutes, it’s normal.

1309
00:58:29.400 --> 00:58:32.112
You learned this when you were a student, but you forgot everything?

1310
00:58:32.179 --> 00:58:33.066
[Embarrassed laughter]

1311
00:58:33.133 --> 00:58:33.966
yes

1312
00:58:34.033 --> 00:58:36.079
That won’t work, Teacher Eom Jae-il.

1313
00:58:36.884 --> 00:58:37.997
Yes?
[Interesting music]

1314
00:58:38.475 --> 00:58:39.424
(Hongdo) Then

1315
00:58:40.100 --> 00:58:41.600
A normal baby

1316
00:58:41.667 --> 00:58:44.634
without other symptoms
Suddenly my face turned a little blue.

1317
00:58:44.701 --> 00:58:45.700
What should I do?

1318
00:58:45.767 --> 00:58:47.066
(Residence in Japan) Write...

1319
00:58:47.133 --> 00:58:48.483
[Jaeil’s groan of worry]

1320
00:58:48.550 --> 00:58:50.467
Invasion?

1321
00:58:50.534 --> 00:58:51.595
No

1322
00:58:52.365 --> 00:58:54.731
You should check the oxygen saturation of the upper and lower extremities.

1323
00:58:55.202 --> 00:58:56.400
Ah, yes

1324
00:58:56.951 --> 00:58:57.801
Okay

1325
00:58:57.868 --> 00:59:00.267
(Hongdo) Then, to the normal baby.

1326
00:59:00.334 --> 00:59:01.801
Suddenly cyanosis appears

1327
00:59:01.868 --> 00:59:03.140
What tests should I do then?

1328
00:59:07.748 --> 00:59:09.579
I need to do an echocardiogram.

1329
00:59:10.181 --> 00:59:11.120
Huh?

1330
00:59:11.187 --> 00:59:13.383
Do you have congenital heart disease?
Shouldn't you check it out?

1331
00:59:15.322 --> 00:59:17.643
yes sorry

1332
00:59:20.027 --> 00:59:21.834
[light laughter]
[lively music]

1333
00:59:21.901 --> 00:59:23.333
sorry

1334
00:59:23.400 --> 00:59:25.762
(Hongdo) Ah, our thoracic surgery department
Because there is no gap for a year

1335
00:59:26.233 --> 00:59:28.702
I also tell the seniors below
I wanted to try something like this

1336
00:59:28.769 --> 00:59:30.033
[Embarrassed laughter]

1337
00:59:31.171 --> 00:59:32.272
Ah, but where is it?

1338
00:59:32.339 --> 00:59:33.233
Eom Jae-il baby?

1339
00:59:33.300 --> 00:59:36.640
Oh, it's the smallest one at the end here.

1340
00:59:37.344 --> 00:59:40.213
(Jaeil) Ah, I’m the shortest here.

1341
00:59:40.280 --> 00:59:42.249
I weigh the least

1342
00:59:42.316 --> 00:59:43.884
I'm in last place here

1343
00:59:43.951 --> 00:59:45.115
(Hongdo) Yes...

1344
00:59:47.910 --> 00:59:49.219
What if I come in last?

1345
00:59:50.591 --> 00:59:52.222
What does it matter that I'm in last place now?

1346
00:59:53.026 --> 00:59:54.638
When you go out, you just have to come in first place.

1347
00:59:58.743 --> 01:00:00.130
It's day 1 of life

1348
01:00:01.235 --> 01:00:02.433
It's just the beginning, well

1349
01:00:12.834 --> 01:00:15.645
(Jooyoung) Retrieving eggs
They say it could hurt for about a week.

1350
01:00:19.160 --> 01:00:21.188
It's okay, I didn't get revenge this time, so what?

1351
01:00:21.255 --> 01:00:22.853
[Subway arrival notification sound]

1352
01:00:25.826 --> 01:00:26.823
Yeah

1353
01:00:27.895 --> 01:00:29.926
I'll let you know when I get a call from the hospital.

1354
01:00:33.534 --> 01:00:34.694
[Call end sound]

1355
01:00:43.544 --> 01:00:44.641
[Jooyoung’s heavy sigh]

1356
01:00:46.113 --> 01:00:47.644
[cell phone ringing sound]

1357
01:00:59.734 --> 01:01:01.258
yes sir hello

1358
01:01:03.334 --> 01:01:05.162
How did it go? How many?

1359
01:01:05.732 --> 01:01:08.600
(Nurse) On the day after egg retrieval
2 have been modified

1360
01:01:08.667 --> 01:01:09.834
As explained

1361
01:01:09.901 --> 01:01:12.669
I cultured the embryo for 5 days for transfer.

1362
01:01:13.901 --> 01:01:16.966
[Sad music]
Both embryos were in bad condition.

1363
01:01:17.033 --> 01:01:18.575
Culture failed.

1364
01:01:19.179 --> 01:01:20.377
Although I'm upset

1365
01:01:21.215 --> 01:01:24.873
I don’t think embryo transfer will be possible this time.

1366
01:01:28.589 --> 01:01:30.233
[Jooyoung groans in pain]
(Man) Oh, I’m sorry.

1367
01:01:30.300 --> 01:01:31.625
[Music: 'Someday I'll Be Wise'
‘Life as a Major’ OST]

1368
01:01:31.692 --> 01:01:33.223
[Jooyoung’s labored breathing]

1369
01:01:35.529 --> 01:01:36.760
[sigh]

1370
01:01:57.267 --> 01:01:59.267
[Sound of grass bugs crying]

1371
01:02:01.054 --> 01:02:02.600
(Nankyung) Have you waited long?

1372
01:02:02.667 --> 01:02:03.753
Are you angry?

1373
01:02:04.234 --> 01:02:06.656
Answer the phone, okay?

1374
01:02:06.723 --> 01:02:07.757
hey!

1375
01:02:08.968 --> 01:02:11.467
I was wrong

1376
01:02:11.534 --> 01:02:12.801
[sigh]

1377
01:02:12.868 --> 01:02:13.797
[Sound of putting down cell phone]

1378
01:02:16.801 --> 01:02:18.038
[Refreshing elasticity]

1379
01:02:18.105 --> 01:02:19.536
[Door bell sounds]
[sigh]

1380
01:02:23.467 --> 01:02:24.444
Why again?

1381
01:02:24.511 --> 01:02:25.542
[Sound of opening a can of beer]

1382
01:02:26.346 --> 01:02:28.734
Let's do it tomorrow, let's do it tomorrow

1383
01:02:28.801 --> 01:02:29.734
(Sabi) What?

1384
01:02:29.801 --> 01:02:31.214
(Nankyung) That’s what you’re trying to do now

1385
01:02:31.968 --> 01:02:34.534
I'm not in the mood to talk right now
I don't even feel like fighting

1386
01:02:34.601 --> 01:02:36.400
I have something I need to say.

1387
01:02:36.467 --> 01:02:38.200
Haha, do it, do it

1388
01:02:38.267 --> 01:02:40.100
What I really want to say is
I can't stand it even for a day

1389
01:02:40.167 --> 01:02:43.634
Look at how the professor organized the paper data.
You gave me a comment

1390
01:02:43.701 --> 01:02:46.029
You left out about 10 people.
[Nanjing’s sigh]

1391
01:02:46.096 --> 01:02:48.231
(Savi) So I filled all 10 people
I sent it again

1392
01:02:48.734 --> 01:02:52.435
Yeah, I was distracted.

1393
01:02:52.934 --> 01:02:54.404
Thank you, okay?

1394
01:02:56.043 --> 01:02:57.107
[Nanjing’s sigh]

1395
01:02:57.945 --> 01:02:59.843
Next is word out.

1396
01:03:00.334 --> 01:03:01.834
(Privately funded) If it’s word out at 6:30

1397
01:03:01.901 --> 01:03:03.213
What you did was right

1398
01:03:04.868 --> 01:03:05.782
But

1399
01:03:06.486 --> 01:03:09.223
Because of that, I told the professor
I didn't know I'd be scolded like that

1400
01:03:10.434 --> 01:03:11.867
When it's time to argue with you

1401
01:03:11.934 --> 01:03:13.667
If I went and explained it to the patient

1402
01:03:13.734 --> 01:03:15.325
I wouldn't have been scolded by the professor.

1403
01:03:17.794 --> 01:03:20.163
That's... I'm sorry.

1404
01:03:21.501 --> 01:03:22.899
Hey, what is it?

1405
01:03:23.667 --> 01:03:25.602
Why are you doing this all of a sudden?

1406
01:03:26.267 --> 01:03:27.804
you just do what you do

1407
01:03:28.442 --> 01:03:30.834
[Calm music]
(Sabi) We need to get the facts straight.

1408
01:03:30.901 --> 01:03:33.577
Whose fault is it and who is sorry?

1409
01:03:35.582 --> 01:03:37.013
That's my rule

1410
01:03:40.834 --> 01:03:42.185
I said everything I had to say

1411
01:03:44.767 --> 01:03:46.656
Me too...

1412
01:03:49.667 --> 01:03:50.660
sorry

1413
01:03:52.065 --> 01:03:54.030
What I told the patient Yeom Miso about you.

1414
01:03:54.801 --> 01:03:57.601
you are inflexible
You said you were the opposite of me.

1415
01:03:58.372 --> 01:04:00.066
I didn't just mean to insult you.

1416
01:04:00.133 --> 01:04:01.771
It's like lamenting my situation.

1417
01:04:02.334 --> 01:04:04.608
Speaking of which, there was some MSG in it too.

1418
01:04:07.714 --> 01:04:08.692
I'm sorry

1419
01:04:12.534 --> 01:04:13.683
I said everything I had to say

1420
01:04:18.000 --> 01:04:20.724
Hey, then we're all solved now, huh?

1421
01:04:26.267 --> 01:04:27.631
But was that about me?

1422
01:04:28.635 --> 01:04:29.534
(Namkyung) Huh?

1423
01:04:30.100 --> 01:04:31.134
Isn't it Oh Yi-young?

1424
01:04:32.434 --> 01:04:33.634
Was it me?

1425
01:04:33.701 --> 01:04:34.672
(Namkyung) Huh?
[humorous music]

1426
01:04:35.976 --> 01:04:37.435
(Sabi) You know,

1427
01:04:37.502 --> 01:04:38.645
In a private conversation with a patient

1428
01:04:38.712 --> 01:04:40.280
Talking about other medical staff
Isn't that rude?

1429
01:04:40.347 --> 01:04:41.911
[Nanjing’s sharp cough]

1430
01:04:42.416 --> 01:04:43.683
and

1431
01:04:43.750 --> 01:04:46.333
That I'm not flexible
But I can't accept it

1432
01:04:46.400 --> 01:04:47.954
- Why, when, what and when?
- (Nanjing) Sabiya

1433
01:04:48.021 --> 01:04:50.524
- Talk while eating squid
- (Sabi) Isn’t there a post-war situation?

1434
01:04:50.591 --> 01:04:52.292
When was I inflexible?

1435
01:04:52.359 --> 01:04:53.727
you held the phone upside down

1436
01:04:53.794 --> 01:04:54.767
say something

1437
01:04:54.834 --> 01:04:55.667
- (Namkyung) Hello?
- (Sabi) cut it off

1438
01:04:55.734 --> 01:04:56.867
- (Namkyung) Oh, wait a minute.
- (Sabi) Hang up the phone.

1439
01:04:56.934 --> 01:04:58.628
- (Nanjing) Wait, I think I have to go.
- (Sabi) I'm talking now.

1440
01:04:59.400 --> 01:05:00.734
(Host) Best Oral Award

1441
01:05:00.801 --> 01:05:03.469
Myeong-won Myung-won of Jongno Yulje Hospital
[Majestic music]

1442
01:05:03.536 --> 01:05:05.068
Name, Myeongwon

1443
01:05:05.572 --> 01:05:07.607
In singleton pregnant women with a short cervix

1444
01:05:07.674 --> 01:05:08.981
After progesterone treatment

1445
01:05:09.048 --> 01:05:10.066
[Continuous camera shutter sound]
Premature birth prediction

1446
01:05:10.133 --> 01:05:11.534
Cervical elasticity test

1447
01:05:11.601 --> 01:05:12.966
As a study on feasibility

1448
01:05:13.033 --> 01:05:15.100
Awarded the Best Storytelling Award

1449
01:05:15.167 --> 01:05:16.616
yes, congratulations

1450
01:05:16.683 --> 01:05:19.682
[Audience applause]

1451
01:05:28.529 --> 01:05:29.767
[Continuous camera shutter sound]

1452
01:05:29.834 --> 01:05:30.927
(President of the Association) Congratulations

1453
01:05:53.520 --> 01:05:55.452
(Eun-won) Teacher Gu Do-won, wait a minute.

1454
01:05:57.000 --> 01:05:58.133
Not long

1455
01:05:58.200 --> 01:06:00.656
This is what Mr. Gu Do-won has
I think it's right

1456
01:06:00.723 --> 01:06:01.958
no, it's okay

1457
01:06:02.467 --> 01:06:04.327
(Eunwon) That’s because I wanted to give it to you.

1458
01:06:04.394 --> 01:06:05.929
(Dowon) No, it’s really okay.

1459
01:06:08.634 --> 01:06:10.100
no

1460
01:06:10.167 --> 01:06:12.235
I wonder if you were offended by me

1461
01:06:12.734 --> 01:06:14.804
(Eunwon) We haven’t talked much since the phone call that day.

1462
01:06:15.400 --> 01:06:17.867
I stole your thesis
You're not misunderstanding, right?

1463
01:06:17.934 --> 01:06:19.976
I know you're not that kind of person, but just in case

1464
01:06:21.200 --> 01:06:23.784
Later in front of the professors
When something strange comes up

1465
01:06:23.851 --> 01:06:25.815
[Laughing slightly] We’re both embarrassed.

1466
01:06:30.634 --> 01:06:32.021
No need to worry

1467
01:06:32.088 --> 01:06:33.827
Thank you, Mr. Goo Do-won.

1468
01:06:33.894 --> 01:06:35.901
I'm really reflecting

1469
01:06:35.968 --> 01:06:38.495
It was really my mistake to forget and not tell you.

1470
01:06:39.533 --> 01:06:40.434
A mistake?

1471
01:06:40.501 --> 01:06:41.898
(Eunwon) Yes, mistake

1472
01:06:42.434 --> 01:06:43.966
I really forgot

1473
01:06:44.033 --> 01:06:46.903
Ah, I don't know why I'm like this these days

1474
01:06:47.400 --> 01:06:49.267
I completely understand that you're not feeling well.

1475
01:06:49.334 --> 01:06:50.700
So will I.

1476
01:06:50.767 --> 01:06:52.700
Next time we're together, something like this will never happen.

1477
01:06:52.767 --> 01:06:53.910
I promise

1478
01:06:54.648 --> 01:06:56.379
If you're hurt, let it out

1479
01:06:57.050 --> 01:07:00.265
Uh, next time I write Professor Ku Do-won’s thesis.
I will help you a lot

1480
01:07:01.634 --> 01:07:02.652
really

1481
01:07:04.087 --> 01:07:05.700
yes, i understand

1482
01:07:05.767 --> 01:07:06.923
I have to go

1483
01:07:08.818 --> 01:07:10.197
(Lee Young) Hello

1484
01:07:10.264 --> 01:07:11.428
Uh, teacher Oh I-young.

1485
01:07:15.400 --> 01:07:16.566
Hey there

1486
01:07:17.100 --> 01:07:19.402
I didn't mean to do that.

1487
01:07:21.108 --> 01:07:23.006
I overheard you twice.

1488
01:07:24.745 --> 01:07:26.453
(Lee Young) It happened like that

1489
01:07:30.133 --> 01:07:31.748
You didn't say you were sorry.

1490
01:07:33.033 --> 01:07:34.050
(Eunwon) Huh?

1491
01:07:37.367 --> 01:07:40.457
You didn't say you were sorry.

1492
01:07:42.667 --> 01:07:43.793
(Eunwon) Uh...

1493
01:07:46.366 --> 01:07:48.933
Didn't I...?

1494
01:07:49.000 --> 01:07:50.033
yes

1495
01:07:53.801 --> 01:07:54.771
[Eunwon’s embarrassed groan]

1496
01:07:55.709 --> 01:07:57.207
I'm sorry, Mr. Goo Do-won.

1497
01:07:58.267 --> 01:08:00.268
[Calm music]

1498
01:08:00.335 --> 01:08:01.446
sorry

1499
01:08:06.300 --> 01:08:07.317
I'll go first

1500
01:08:19.400 --> 01:08:20.396
Let's go home

1501
01:08:35.567 --> 01:08:37.113
[Sound of opening a can of beer]

1502
01:08:42.055 --> 01:08:43.333
(Dowon) Why are you saying that?

1503
01:08:43.400 --> 01:08:45.233
I don't need an apology or anything like that.

1504
01:08:45.300 --> 01:08:46.589
(Lee Young) I need it, right?

1505
01:08:50.564 --> 01:08:52.496
[Refreshed] I guess I can survive now

1506
01:08:53.800 --> 01:08:55.265
[Lee Young’s burp]
[Do-won’s light smile]

1507
01:08:56.803 --> 01:08:59.268
It's because I feel like my in-laws are completely captured.

1508
01:08:59.335 --> 01:09:02.567
future hospital life
Man, it won't be easy.

1509
01:09:02.634 --> 01:09:04.834
It's okay, you can stop, whatever.

1510
01:09:04.901 --> 01:09:05.842
(Dowon) Yes?

1511
01:09:06.767 --> 01:09:09.516
Oh, isn’t Mr. Gu Do-won angry?
Aren’t you upset?

1512
01:09:09.583 --> 01:09:11.318
Bodhisattva, Jesus, what?

1513
01:09:11.385 --> 01:09:12.834
He's a fanatic

1514
01:09:12.901 --> 01:09:13.883
Hogu Dowon

1515
01:09:14.855 --> 01:09:15.919
Did you forget?

1516
01:09:16.623 --> 01:09:17.676
What did you say

1517
01:09:21.094 --> 01:09:23.154
Ah, the more I think about it, the angrier I get.

1518
01:09:26.148 --> 01:09:28.932
[Beeping sound effect]
Shit, have you ever seen a bastard like this?

1519
01:09:28.999 --> 01:09:31.400
(Lee Young) This is such a crazy idiot.

1520
01:09:31.467 --> 01:09:33.534
You can say whatever you want with your open mouth.

1521
01:09:33.601 --> 01:09:34.537
[Beeping sound effect]
You bastard!

1522
01:09:36.067 --> 01:09:37.740
[Dowon’s laughter]

1523
01:09:39.346 --> 01:09:41.834
(Dowon) No, did you just memorize it again?

1524
01:09:41.901 --> 01:09:42.867
You memorized it right away?

1525
01:09:42.934 --> 01:09:44.267
Good job!

1526
01:09:44.334 --> 01:09:45.167
I have talent

1527
01:09:45.234 --> 01:09:47.183
As soon as I first heard it, it stuck with me.

1528
01:09:48.088 --> 01:09:49.200
I guess I have a bad temper

1529
01:09:49.267 --> 01:09:51.267
[Sound of grass bugs crying]

1530
01:09:55.729 --> 01:09:57.455
When do you say you like me?

1531
01:09:58.131 --> 01:09:59.294
Have you changed your mind?

1532
01:10:01.785 --> 01:10:04.067
No, in front of someone you like
Are you swearing like that?

1533
01:10:07.934 --> 01:10:09.509
I guess my mind has left now

1534
01:10:09.576 --> 01:10:10.640
(Lee Young) Isn’t it?

1535
01:10:12.412 --> 01:10:14.256
still valid

1536
01:10:18.151 --> 01:10:21.050
Even though I like him, he’s the type of person who swears.

1537
01:10:26.033 --> 01:10:27.090
I guess he's a fool

1538
01:10:29.129 --> 01:10:30.193
[Dowon’s laughter]

1539
01:10:34.534 --> 01:10:36.265
Then can you say that one more time?

1540
01:10:37.934 --> 01:10:40.006
[Music: 'Someday I'll Be Wise'
‘Life as a Major’ OST]

1541
01:10:40.073 --> 01:10:41.137
Really?

1542
01:10:52.767 --> 01:10:55.585
Can I like it?

1543
01:11:08.968 --> 01:11:10.133
Oh, not that one.

1544
01:11:15.909 --> 01:11:16.947
Ah!

1545
01:11:19.012 --> 01:11:21.411
What the fuck is that?

1546
01:11:23.984 --> 01:11:25.181
[한숨]

1547
01:11:31.458 --> 01:11:33.927
잘 들어요, 딱 한 번만 해 줄 거니까

1548
01:11:33.994 --> 01:11:35.024
(도원) 네

1549
01:11:37.367 --> 01:11:39.829
[삐 울리는 효과음]
시X 이런 X 같은 새끼를 봤나

1550
01:11:40.634 --> 01:11:42.636
이거 완전 미친 새끼네
[도원의 웃음]

1551
01:11:42.703 --> 01:11:43.734
(이영) 어딜 뚫린 입이라고

1552
01:11:43.801 --> 01:11:46.066
지 마음대로 지껄여, 이 X새끼가!
[Beeping sound effect]

1553
01:11:46.133 --> 01:11:47.370
[Dowon’s laughter]

1554
01:11:52.119 --> 01:11:54.420
A twin bastard
[Dowon’s laughter]

1555
01:11:55.415 --> 01:11:56.901
I'm talking bullshit

1556
01:11:56.968 --> 01:11:58.066
That didn't exist

1557
01:11:58.133 --> 01:11:59.782
Oh, this is mine
[Lee Young and Dowon’s laughter]

1558
01:12:24.044 --> 01:12:26.255
[Music: 'Someday I'll Be Wise'
‘Life as a Major’ OST-Continued]

1559
01:13:22.417 --> 01:13:24.538
(Jaehwi) Are you already preparing to recruit interns?

1560
01:13:24.605 --> 01:13:26.940
(Jeongmin) This is my first year farming.
It wasn't right

1561
01:13:27.007 --> 01:13:28.968
(Temperature) Everyone is a little sick

1562
01:13:29.610 --> 01:13:31.574
(Nankyung) Are you smiling? Is this funny!

1563
01:13:32.400 --> 01:13:35.167
(Dongho) No, anesthesiology
How many times a day do you call me?

1564
01:13:35.234 --> 01:13:37.918
(Lee Young) I know too.
Please just this once

1565
01:13:37.985 --> 01:13:38.848
(Together) I guess the mother came to give birth.

1566
01:13:38.915 --> 01:13:40.850
(Mugang) Yes? Are you saying you won't come out today?

1567
01:13:40.917 --> 01:13:43.586
If the harvest is poor next year, we will all be ruined.

1568
01:13:44.367 --> 01:13:46.560
(Jeongmin) Teacher Koo Do-won, are you on vacation starting tomorrow?

1569
01:13:46.627 --> 01:13:49.425
(Dowon) Where are you on the phone?
You especially Eom Jae-il

1570
01:13:49.492 --> 01:13:51.327
The vacation isn't 3 months, it's only 3 days?

1571
01:13:51.394 --> 01:13:52.400
(Nanjing) Don’t worry

1572
01:13:52.467 --> 01:13:53.934
(Dowon) Goodbye

1573
01:13:54.001 --> 01:13:56.899
(Xavi) If you ask a question, ask the Chief.

1574
01:13:56.966 --> 01:13:59.539
(Lee Young) How many times do I tell you that I don’t have a rescuer?

1575
01:13:59.606 --> 01:14:01.942
(Mugang) [In pain] Oh, the mountains and the real thing!

1576
01:14:02.009 --> 01:14:03.009
Why are you angry?

1577
01:14:03.076 --> 01:14:05.133
(Mugang) I said no
I'm giving it to you.

1578
01:14:05.200 --> 01:14:06.709
(Junseok) Then should we not call?

1579
01:14:06.776 --> 01:14:08.834
(Lee Young) Because everyone tolerates us
I think you're really stupid

1580
01:14:08.901 --> 01:14:10.901
(Sabi) That’s right, if you endure it three times,

1581
01:14:10.968 --> 01:14:12.175
I held back too much

1582
01:14:12.242 --> 01:14:14.754
(Japan) I got sick, no!

1583
01:14:14.821 --> 01:14:16.100
(Lee Young) Huh?
[Mother’s moans of pain]

1584
01:14:16.167 --> 01:14:17.324
Does it hurt? Does your stomach hurt?

1585
01:14:17.391 --> 01:14:19.744
They said you went to emergency surgery.
How do you really do it?

1586
01:14:20.767 --> 01:14:23.559
Don't Worry, I'm a Famous Doctor

